<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_section"><a href="#S7" title="In V-SEAM: Visual Semantic Editing and Attention Modulating for Causal Interpretability of Vision-Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">7 </span>Conclusion</span></a></li>
