<td id="A1.T6.2.1.2.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_r ltx_border_t" style="padding-top:1.25pt;padding-bottom:1.25pt;">Is the shirt <span id="A1.T6.2.1.2.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">blue</span>?</td>
